  "name": "feat: event-source progress notes (lock-free concurrent updates)",
  "slug": "feat-event-source-progress-notes-lock-free-concurrent-update",
  "spec": {
    "summary": "Make a progress note a pure immutable event (ULID file, no lock, conflict-free) and DERIVE latest_note/last_activity_at at read time instead of mutating the ticket. Removes lock contention for concurrent update --progress; lock kept only for state transitions + cascade. Pairs with parked derive-updated_at-from-events.",
    "details_md": "",
    "acceptance": [
      "update --progress appends an event and does NOT lock or mutate the ticket file",
      "latest_note/last_activity_at + staleness derived from events, matching prior behavior",
      "N concurrent update --progress never contend/conflict (test proves it)",
      "status/show/ready/staleness output unchanged for single-writer cases"
    ],
